
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="SAM ENTERPRISES LLC provides renovations, repairs, roofing, fencing, painting, flooring, drywall and welding in the New Orleans area." />
  <title>SAM ENTERPRISES LLC | New Orleans Renovations & Repairs</title>
  <style is:global>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #f5f3ee; color: #18232d; line-height: 1.6; }
    a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #b88739; outline-offset: 4px; }
    header { background: #142b38; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 26px 6% 18px; }
    .company-logo { display: block; width: 180px; max-width: 80%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 14px; object-fit: contain; }
    .brand { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; }
    .tagline { color: #d8e1e6; margin: 4px auto 14px; }
    nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px 24px; }
    nav a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
    nav a:hover, footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    main { max-width: 1150px; margin: auto; }
    section { padding: 56px 6%; }
    .hero { text-align: center; padding-top: 76px; padding-bottom: 76px; }
    .label { color: #715326; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px); line-height: 1.2; margin: 18px auto 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(25px, 4vw, 32px); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 15px; }
    h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    p { max-width: 760px; }
    .hero p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .intro { font-size: 20px; color: #52616a; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #142b38; color: #fff; padding: 14px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 18px; }
    .button:hover { background: #284859; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 250px), 1fr)); gap: 18px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e1ded6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 26px; }
    .card p { margin: 0; color: #52616a; }
    .project-gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 25px; }
    .project-gallery a { display: block; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 12px; background: #e9e6de; }
    .project-gallery img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .2s ease; }
    .project-gallery a:hover img { transform: scale(1.025); }
    .gallery-note { color: #52616a; font-size: 14px; }
    .about { background: #e9e6de; border-radius: 8px; }
    footer { background: #142b38; color: #fff; padding: 36px 6%; margin-top: 40px; }
    footer .footer-inner { max-width: 1050px; margin: auto; }
    footer a, footer a:visited { color: #fff !important; }
    footer p { margin: 8px 0; }
    footer h2 { margin-top: 28px; }
    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      section { padding: 42px 5%; }
      .hero { padding-top: 55px; padding-bottom: 55px; }
      .project-gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
      .project-gallery img { height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      .project-gallery img { transition: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <img src="/Sam-logo.jpg.jpg" alt="SAM Enterprises LLC logo" class="company-logo" />
    <div class="brand">SAM ENTERPRISES LLC</div>
    <p class="tagline">Renovations &amp; Repairs · New Orleans</p>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#gallery">Our Work</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="label">BUILT WITH CARE.</div>
      <h1>Your next project.<br />Our hands-on approach.</h1>
      <p class="intro">From everyday repairs to property improvements, SAM ENTERPRISES LLC helps bring your project to life throughout the New Orleans area.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#contact">Discuss Your Project</a>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <h2>Work We Do</h2>
      <p>Practical solutions for your home and property.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><h3>Renovations &amp; Repairs</h3><p>Interior improvements, carpentry, framing, and general property repairs.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Fences &amp; Gates</h3><p>Wood and metal fencing, custom gates, installation, and repairs.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Painting &amp; Drywall</h3><p>Interior and exterior painting, drywall installation, patching, and finishing.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Tile &amp; Flooring</h3><p>Ceramic tile, vinyl flooring, and flooring repairs.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Exterior Improvements</h3><p>Siding, fascia repairs, deck repairs, and exterior maintenance.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Roofing &amp; Roof Repairs</h3><p>Shingle installation, roof repairs, leak repairs, fascia replacement, and roofing maintenance.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Welding &amp; Metal Repairs</h3><p>Welding and repairs for metal gates, fences, and other property features.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

   
<section id="gallery">
  <h2>Our Work</h2>
  <p>Explore completed projects and work in progress by SAM ENTERPRISES LLC.</p>

  <div class="project-gallery">
    {[
      {
        name: "Roofing — Catalina Project",
        photos: [
          "IMG_2957.jpeg", "IMG_2958.jpeg",
          "IMG_2982.jpeg", "IMG_2983.jpeg",
          "IMG_2984.jpeg"
        ]
      },
      {
        name: "Masonry & Brick Restoration",
        photos: [
          "IMG_0945.jpeg", "IMG_0947.jpeg",
          "IMG_0948.jpeg", "IMG_3410.jpeg",
          "IMG_3427.jpeg", "IMG_3464.jpeg",
          "IMG_3465.jpeg", "IMG_3466.jpeg",
          "IMG_3467.jpeg"
        ]
      },
      {
        name: "Fences & Gates",
        photos: ["IMG_3156.jpeg"]
      },
      {
        name: "Exterior Wall Sheathing",
        photos: [
          "IMG_0795.jpeg", "IMG_0918.jpeg",
          "IMG_0921.jpeg"
        ]
      }
    ].map((project) => (
      <details class="project-category">
        <summary>{project.name}</summary>
        <div class="project-photos">
          {project.photos.map((photo) => (
            <a href={`/${photo}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <img src={`/${photo}`} alt={`${project.name} construction project`} loading="lazy" />
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </details>
    ))}
  </div>

  <style>
    .project-gallery {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .project-category {
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .project-category summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .project-photos {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .project-photos img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .project-photos {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</section>


    <section class="about" id="about">
      <h2>Local Work. Personal Attention.</h2>
      <p>SAM ENTERPRISES LLC is led by Steven Murillo and serves the New Orleans area with hands-on renovation and repair services.</p>
      <p>We focus on understanding your project, explaining the scope of work, and paying attention to the details.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Serving the New Orleans Area</h2>
      <p>Have a repair or improvement in mind? Send a few photos and a short description of your project so we can discuss the work you need.</p>
      <a class="button" href="mailto:Steven@samgc.com?subject=Project%20Inquiry">Email Us About Your Project</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <strong>SAM ENTERPRISES LLC</strong>
      <p>Renovations &amp; Repairs · New Orleans, Louisiana</p>
      <section id="contact" style="padding: 12px 0 0;">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:Steven@samgc.com">Steven@samgc.com</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="https://www.samgc.com">www.samgc.com</a></p>
        <p>Location: New Orleans, Louisiana</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
